Here is the complete **end-to-end flow** for:

> **User asks: “Summarize RPT-10025.”**

This combines:

```text
Text-to-MQL
+ Planner
+ Business SOP
+ MongoDB execution
+ Reasoning
+ Final summary
```

# End-to-end architecture

```text
User Query
   ↓
1. Input Guardrail
   ↓
2. Intent Router
   ↓
3. Entity Extractor
   ↓
4. Context Resolver
   ↓
5. SOP Retriever
   ↓
6. Metadata Retriever
   ↓
7. Planner
   ↓
8. MQL Generator
   ↓
9. MQL Validator
   ↓
10. MongoDB Executor
   ↓
11. Result Validator
   ↓
12. Reasoning / Summary Agent
   ↓
13. Response Validator
   ↓
14. Final User Response
   ↓
15. Audit and Observability
```

